  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a qi path dream realm, Fang Yuan finds three immortal materials with qi flow Immortal Gu and many rank five qi path mortal Gu: black iron qi, orchid vitality qi, and moving dragon qi. He uses those materials as supplementary fuel for immortal killer moves built around qi flow Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1809
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "gu_qi_flow_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Orchid vitality qi can heal him. After the first stage he finds orchid vitality qi still intact while moving dragon qi and iron qi are partly spent, then expends a small portion when activating Orchid Breath. The move makes his breath fragrant and full of vitality, like a dense light-green fog that covers his body and mostly recovers his injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        1809
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_orchid_breath"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Moving dragon qi from the same trio is covered on moving dragon qi. In the second stage of that dream realm, autumn scale concealment qi is among qi path immortal materials in a mountain cave tunnel and is the biggest help to him; that find is covered on autumn scale concealment qi.",
      "chapters": [
        1809
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_moving_dragon_qi",
        "res_autumn_scale_concealment_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing’s group discovers orchid vitality qi among other immortal materials in Earth Treasury, listed after metal, food, and wind path materials found in the same cave.",
      "chapters": [
        2076
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-treasury-find",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "reg_earth_earth_treasury"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan annexes Qi Xiang grotto-heaven, orchid vitality qi appears among immortal materials that form in the sovereign immortal aperture alongside blood qi, astral qi, life qi, death qi, and other named qi materials.",
      "chapters": [
        2109
      ],
